WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.429
Welcome to Orbit. At the café. Our focus is some / any.

2
00:00:06.429 --> 00:00:16.891
Use some in positive sentences. Use any in most questions and negative sentences. A and an are used with singular countable nouns.

3
00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:19.385
There is an apple on the table.

4
00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.900
We have some bread for lunch.

5
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.549
Is there any milk in the fridge?

6
00:00:24.549 --> 00:00:33.947
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
